  "guidesPageSubtitle": "Tips for capture, review, vocabulary, and everyday use.",
  "guidesIntroTitle": "Getting around",
  "guidesIntroBody": "Use the tabs on the left: Dashboard for your learning snapshot; Capture to grab text from other apps; Review for SRS sessions; Vocabulary to browse and organize cards; Guides for tips like these; Settings for language, backups, and hotkeys; About for versions, Pro, and support.",
  "guidesCaptureTitle": "Capture",
  "guidesCaptureBody": "Keyboard shortcuts (when registered): typically Ctrl+Shift+D for selected text and Ctrl+Shift+X for region OCR—see the Capture tab if global registration fails. Turn on Auto capture to follow mouse text selection in other apps, or capture from the Capture tab. In the popup, drag-select in the source field to translate only a phrase; save adds the card to your library.",
  "guidesReviewTitle": "Review (SRS)",
  "guidesReviewBody": "The Review tab runs spaced repetition. Grade each card honestly so intervals stay meaningful. Pro unlocks mixed review (forward, reverse meaning, and reverse audio in one session).",
  "guidesVocabTitle": "Vocabulary",
  "guidesVocabBody": "Search, tag, archive, and edit entries in the Vocabulary tab. Sync and export options depend on your account and backup settings under Settings.",
  "guidesSettingsTitle": "Settings & backup",
  "guidesSettingsBody": "Set your native language for translations, adjust text scale, configure the auto-capture toggle hotkey, and choose local backup folders. Keeping backups protects you when reinstalling or moving to a new PC.",
  "guidesProTitle": "Free and Pro",
  "guidesProBody": "Free tier may apply daily limits on desktop capture saves and capture-popup translation requests (phrases served from cache usually do not count). Pro removes banner ads on desktop, unlocks mixed review and unlimited SRS grades per day, and removes those desktop capture limits. Open the About tab for update checks, activation, and a link to buy Pro.",
